{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-pipeline","title":"WebGL 渲染管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/webgl/rendering-pipeline","wordCount":1488,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"webgl-渲染管线\">WebGL 渲染管线</h1><p>第一次读 WebGL 代码的人几乎都会被劝退：几十行样板才画出一个三角形，<code>gl.bindBuffer</code>、<code>gl.enableVertexAttribArray</code>、<code>gl.drawArrays</code> 像咒语一样排在一起，不知所云。破解的钥匙只有一把——理解<strong>渲染管线</strong>：一个顶点从你的数组出发，要经过哪几道固定的工序，才变成屏幕上一个有颜色的像素。把这条流水线看清楚，那些咒语立刻各归其位，每一行都对应管线上的某个环节。这篇文档只讲管线的骨架，不深入着色器代码（那是下一篇的事）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一条顶点到片元的流水线\">核心概念：一条顶点到片元的流水线</h2><p>GPU 渲染是一条阶段固定、数据单向流动的流水线。你提供顶点数据和两个着色器程序，GPU 按下面的顺序把它们变成像素：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[顶点数据 VBO&lt;br/&gt;位置/颜色/UV] --&gt; B[顶点着色器&lt;br/&gt;逐顶点运行, 算裁剪空间坐标]&#10;  B --&gt; C[图元装配&lt;br/&gt;顶点组装成点/线/三角形]&#10;  C --&gt; D[裁剪与透视除法&lt;br/&gt;裁掉视锥外, 归一化]&#10;  D --&gt; E[光栅化&lt;br/&gt;三角形离散成片元/候选像素]&#10;  E --&gt; F[片元着色器&lt;br/&gt;逐片元运行, 算颜色]&#10;  F --&gt; G[逐片元测试&lt;br/&gt;深度测试/模板/混合]&#10;  G --&gt; H[帧缓冲&lt;br/&gt;屏幕像素]\">flowchart TD\n  A[顶点数据 VBO&lt;br/&gt;位置/颜色/UV] --&gt; B[顶点着色器&lt;br/&gt;逐顶点运行, 算裁剪空间坐标]\n  B --&gt; C[图元装配&lt;br/&gt;顶点组装成点/线/三角形]\n  C --&gt; D[裁剪与透视除法&lt;br/&gt;裁掉视锥外, 归一化]\n  D --&gt; E[光栅化&lt;br/&gt;三角形离散成片元/候选像素]\n  E --&gt; F[片元着色器&lt;br/&gt;逐片元运行, 算颜色]\n  F --&gt; G[逐片元测试&lt;br/&gt;深度测试/模板/混合]\n  G --&gt; H[帧缓冲&lt;br/&gt;屏幕像素]</pre><p>这条流水线里，只有两个阶段是<strong>可编程</strong>的——顶点着色器和片元着色器，其余（图元装配、裁剪、光栅化、深度测试）是<strong>固定功能</strong>，由 GPU 硬件按你设置的状态执行。理解这一点极其重要：你能控制的就是「每个顶点怎么变换」和「每个像素涂什么颜色」，中间的光栅化不是你写的代码，而是 GPU 把三角形填满像素的硬件过程。两个可编程阶段的具体写法，是下一篇 <a href=\"shaders-glsl\">着色器与 GLSL</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两个可编程阶段-顶点与片元\">两个可编程阶段：顶点与片元</h2><p><strong>顶点着色器</strong>逐顶点运行一次：输入一个顶点的属性（位置、法线、颜色、纹理坐标），输出这个顶点在<strong>裁剪空间</strong>里的坐标（写进内置变量 <code>gl_Position</code>）。它的核心工作是坐标变换——把模型局部坐标经过一连串矩阵乘法搬到裁剪空间。如果你的模型有一万个顶点，它就并行运行一万次。</p>\n<p><strong>片元着色器</strong>逐片元运行一次：光栅化把三角形铺成许多「片元」（candidate pixel），每个片元都跑一遍片元着色器，输出这个片元的最终颜色（写进 <code>gl_FragColor</code> 或 out 变量）。纹理采样、光照计算、逐像素特效都在这里发生。一个铺满屏幕的三角形可能产生上百万个片元，片元着色器就并行运行上百万次——这也是为什么片元着色器里一行昂贵的计算会被放大成巨大的开销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th align=\"center\">可编程</th>\n<th>运行频率</th>\n<th>主要职责</th>\n<th>关键输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶点着色器</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>每顶点一次</td>\n<td>坐标变换</td>\n<td><code>gl_Position</code>（裁剪空间坐标）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图元装配</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>每图元</td>\n<td>顶点组装成三角形/线/点</td>\n<td>图元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光栅化</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否</td>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>三角形离散为片元</td>\n<td>片元流 + 插值后的 varying</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>片元着色器</td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>每片元一次</td>\n<td>计算颜色</td>\n<td>片元颜色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度/混合测试</td>\n<td align=\"center\">否（可配）</td>\n<td>每片元</td>\n<td>决定是否写入、如何混合</td>\n<td>帧缓冲像素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"坐标空间的旅程-从模型到屏幕\">坐标空间的旅程：从模型到屏幕</h2><p>顶点着色器的核心是把顶点在多个坐标空间之间搬运，这段旅程是理解 3D 渲染的骨架。一个顶点依次经过：模型空间 → 世界空间 → 观察空间 → 裁剪空间 → 归一化设备坐标（NDC）→ 屏幕坐标。前三步各由一个矩阵完成，合起来常写作 MVP 矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mtext>clip</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>proj</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>view</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{p}_{\\text{clip}} = M_{\\text{proj}} \\cdot M_{\\text{view}} \\cdot M_{\\text{model}} \\cdot \\mathbf{p}_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7305em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">clip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">proj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">view</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是齐次坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y, z, w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这些 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\times 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵和 Canvas 2D 里那个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 变换矩阵是同一套数学的高维版本（见 <a href=\"../canvas2d/drawing-context\">绘图上下文与状态机</a> 里的齐次坐标）。到裁剪空间后，GPU 做<strong>透视除法</strong>——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y,z,w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 各分量除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，得到 NDC：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi><mtext>ndc</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>w</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mi>w</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>各分量</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{p}_{\\text{ndc}} = \\left(\\frac{x}{w}, \\frac{y}{w}, \\frac{z}{w}\\right),\\quad \\text{各分量} \\in [-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ndc</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.836em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">各分量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正是这一步除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 制造了「近大远小」的透视效果。NDC 是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-1,1]^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的立方体，落在外面的图元被裁剪掉。最后 GPU 按视口（viewport）设置把 NDC 的 xy 映射到屏幕像素坐标。矩阵怎么构造、观察与投影矩阵的推导，属于三维范畴，见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/webgl-overview\">Web 3D 可视化 · WebGL 概览</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"webgl-是一台巨大的状态机\">WebGL 是一台巨大的状态机</h2><p>写 WebGL 那些「咒语」之所以难懂，是因为 WebGL 的 API 风格是<strong>状态机</strong>，而非「传参调用」。你不是把数据作为参数传给绘制函数，而是先通过一系列 <code>bind</code>/<code>enable</code>/设置把 GPU 调到某个状态，再调用 <code>drawArrays</code>/<code>drawElements</code>「按当前状态画一次」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, positionBuffer); // 状态：当前顶点缓冲&#10;gl.enableVertexAttribArray(posLoc); // 状态：启用属性槽&#10;gl.vertexAttribPointer(posLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0); // 状态：如何读缓冲&#10;gl.useProgram(program); // 状态：当前着色器程序&#10;gl.uniformMatrix4fv(mvpLoc, false, mvpMatrix); // 状态：uniform 值&#10;gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, vertexCount); // 按以上全部状态画一次\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bindBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ARRAY_BUFFER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, positionBuffer); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 状态：当前顶点缓冲</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enableVertexAttribArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(posLoc); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 状态：启用属性槽</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vertexAttribPointer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(posLoc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FLOAT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 状态：如何读缓冲</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useProgram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(program); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 状态：当前着色器程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uniformMatrix4fv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mvpLoc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, mvpMatrix); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 状态：uniform 值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawArrays</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gl.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TRIANGLES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vertexCount); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 按以上全部状态画一次</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每一行都在改「全局当前状态」，最后一行触发绘制。这个模型的代价是状态容易互相污染（忘了解绑、上一个 program 的状态残留），好处是切换状态比重传全部数据便宜。理解它就能明白：一次 <code>drawArrays</code> 就是一次 <strong>draw call</strong>，而每次 draw call 前的状态切换（换 buffer、换 texture、换 program）都有开销——这正是性能优化的战场。如何把成百上千次 draw call 合并成几次，是实践章 <a href=\"../practice/batching-performance\">批处理与性能</a> 的核心。缓冲和属性指针的细节，见 <a href=\"buffers-textures\">缓冲与纹理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WebGL 渲染是一条固定顺序的流水线：顶点数据 → 顶点着色器 → 图元装配 → 裁剪/透视除法 → 光栅化 → 片元着色器 → 深度/混合测试 → 帧缓冲。</li>\n<li>流水线里只有顶点着色器和片元着色器可编程，其余是固定功能硬件；你控制的是「顶点怎么变换」和「片元涂什么色」，光栅化由 GPU 自动完成。</li>\n<li>顶点在模型→世界→观察→裁剪→NDC→屏幕的坐标空间里旅行，由 MVP 矩阵驱动，透视除法（除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>）制造近大远小；这套数学是 Canvas 2D 变换矩阵的高维版。</li>\n<li>WebGL 是状态机 API：先 bind/enable/设 uniform 把 GPU 调到某状态，再 <code>drawArrays</code> 触发一次 draw call；状态切换有开销，是批处理优化的战场。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"shaders-glsl\">着色器与 GLSL</a> 展开两个可编程阶段的代码；<a href=\"buffers-textures\">缓冲与纹理</a> 讲顶点数据如何喂进管线；draw call 优化见 <a href=\"../practice/batching-performance\">批处理与性能</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：MVP 矩阵与相机投影的构造见 <a href=\"../../web3d-visualization/webgl-fundamentals/webgl-overview\">Web 3D 可视化 · WebGL 概览</a>；下一代管线的对照见 <a href=\"../../webgpu-graphics/foundations/gpu-pipeline-model\">WebGPU 图形 · GPU 管线模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WebGL 渲染管线","id":"webgl-渲染管线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一条顶点到片元的流水线","id":"核心概念-一条顶点到片元的流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"两个可编程阶段：顶点与片元","id":"两个可编程阶段-顶点与片元"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标空间的旅程：从模型到屏幕","id":"坐标空间的旅程-从模型到屏幕"},{"level":2,"text":"WebGL 是一台巨大的状态机","id":"webgl-是一台巨大的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"位图与像素操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/canvas2d/images-pixels"},"next":{"title":"着色器与 GLSL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/webgl/shaders-glsl"}}